                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6ead1943-1a7a-3594-ab50-6bf9a9ad7800",
                        "entry_id": "9035fe33-8ed0-3b6a-bbe7-e67cec6703c6",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The formatting of a hard drive, a database, etc. into different partitions."
